{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Note that, while you can find assignments here, submission itself goes through the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://blackboard.syr.edu"}}{\fldrslt{\ul
course Blackboard
}}}
 \u8212- with one exception, the Project Application, which is submitted through a Qualtrics link.\par}
