.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Each assignment page carries its instructions, any templates you need to download, and the {\b Guidelines} that apply to it. Guidelines appear under the assignment where they are first needed; later assignments link back to them.\par}
